      "title": "test: Skip tshark extcap test if sampleif.py execute bit is clear",
      "message": "test: Skip tshark extcap test if sampleif.py execute bit is clear\n\nExtcaps have to be executable, so sampleif.py has the execute bit\nset in the git repository, which is also applied to clones - unless\nthe git config core.fileMode is set to false.\n\nSince it's a Python extcap instead of a binary, we could run the\nscript anyway through an interpreter, but not for testing tshark\nloading the interface end to end. Just skip the test.\n",
